        "original_id": "f2aba2d4-73e5-5eeb-a539-bf2e4b3c10bc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Formula One Arcade\n- Companies: Studio 33, Sony Computer Entertainment, Scuderia Ferrari\n- People: Eddie Irvine, Michael Schumacher, Jarno Trulli\n- Topics: Formula One, World Drivers' Championship\n\nFacts:\n- Eddie Irvine was a Formula One driver from 1993 to 2002.\n- Eddie Irvine was the runner-up in the 1999 World Drivers' Championship while driving for Scuderia Ferrari.\n- Formula One Arcade is a racing video game developed by Studio 33 and published by Sony Computer Entertainment for the PlayStation.\n- The front cover of Formula One Arcade features Eddie Irvine, Michael Schumacher, and Jarno Trulli from left to right.",
